prakticalc (1.5.2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Added Fedora RPM builds
  * Added new Debian package build system with source package support
  * Reworked theming to work without ttkthemes
  * Added "clam" and "alt" ttk themes to settings menu
  * Added memory append, add and subtract operations
  * Improved DPI scaling and accuracy in PraktiGraph
  * Added unicode superscript support in PraktiGraph
  * Updated the Extension Manager
    - added a link to the PraktiXtension gallery
    - descriptions now use fixed-width font and a scrollbar
    - file open dialogs now start in the user's home directory
  * Improved the info dialog
    - it now shows the used version of Tk
    - if VBS is used, it shows the VBScript version as well
    - it only mentions ttkthemes if it's actually in use
    - some Tk bitmaps are shown if in debug mode
  * AppleScript dialogs now have window titles
  * Pressing "X" now opens the extension window

