prakticalc (1.5) stable; urgency=medium

  * huge code restructure
  * fixed Windows uninstaller not always running as administrator
  * changed Windows installer to use unicode bullet points
  * changed Windows installer to show a messagebox for CLI help
  * reworked settings menu and added more options for appearance & bevavior
  * added scrollbar to console
  * added an option to change themes graphically on nearly all platforms
  * added eval command to console
  * added persistent configuration storage with platform-specific backends
  * added support for dark window title bars on Windows
  * removed dependency on SimpleEval
  * reintroduced support for TinyCore Linux
  * reintroduced Xdialog support
  * added pi constant
  * fixed error when exiting through the console
  * made it possible to close more dialogs with the enter key
  * added support for gxmessage
  * added support for notify-send
  * changed logo in console about window to always be centered
  * added an extension system, more on github.com/karl152/PraktiXtensions
  * added graphical extension manager and PraktiGraph (plotter)
  * changed multiplication symbol from "x" to "*"
  * added support for multiple angle units (degrees, radians, gradians)
  * added asin, sinh, asinh, acos, cosh, acosh, atan, tanh, atanh
  * added Euler's number
  * added factorial
  * added menu bar and restructured elements of the GUI
  * changed Windows uninstaller to use PowerShell and wait longer
  * made the progress bar in the Windows installer more accurate
  * changed Windows installer to make in-place upgrades possible
  * improved the size of the main window
  * added option to clear the memory
  * added the Python Powered logo to info dialog
  * changed the info dialog to use more padding
  * changed some text to use sentence case
  * improved dark mode on macOS and Windows (classic, high contrast)
  * added memory display to show the current value stored in memory
  * changed console about window to show Tcl/Tk version
  * changed portable Windows builds to be ZIP files
  * removed space between license box and scrollbar in Windows installer
  * added Wmessage support
  * removed many CLI arguments
  * fixed macOS icon being too big
  * changed RDNS name
  * improved DPI awareness on Windows
  * added confget command to console for getting configuration values
  * added support for AppImageUpdate
  * changed Windows uninstaller to use another hourglass icon

